    {
      "source": "Returns a bindable parameter with the given index. So for a method with a signature of\n<code>(Pageable pageable, String name)</code> a call to <code>#getBindableParameter(0)</code> will return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>\nparameter.",
      "translation": "返回具有给定索引的可绑定参数。因此，对于签名如 <code>(Pageable pageable, String name)</code> 的方法，调用 <code>#getBindableParameter(0)</code> 将返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
